{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":7,"ref":"numbers 4:7","book":"numbers","lang":"id","chapter":4,"translation":"Dan di atas meja penghadapan mereka akan membentangkan kain tekelet, dan menaruh di atasnya ⟨את⟩ pinggan-pinggan, ⟨את⟩ cawan-cawan, ⟨את⟩ sampolet-sampolet, dan ⟨את⟩ kendi-kendi tuangan; dan roti yang tetap ada di atasnya akan tetap di sana.","tokens":[{"surface":"ועל","gloss":"dan di atas"},{"surface":"שלחן","gloss":"meja"},{"surface":"הפנים","gloss":"penghadapan"},{"surface":"יפרשו","gloss":"mereka akan membentangkan"},{"surface":"בגד","gloss":"kain"},{"surface":"תכלת","gloss":"tekelet (kain biru)"},{"surface":"ונתנו","gloss":"dan mereka akan menaruh"},{"surface":"עליו","gloss":"di atasnya"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"pinggan-pinggan"},{"surface":"הקערת","gloss":"pinggan-pinggan"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"cawan-cawan"},{"surface":"הכפת","gloss":"cawan-cawan"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"sampolet-sampolet"},{"surface":"המנקית","gloss":"sampolet-sampolet"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"kendi-kendi tuangan"},{"surface":"קשות","gloss":"kendi-kendi"},{"surface":"הנסך","gloss":"tuungan"},{"surface":"ולחם","gloss":"dan roti"},{"surface":"התמיד","gloss":"yang tetap"},{"surface":"עליו","gloss":"di atasnya"},{"surface":"יהיה","gloss":"akan tetap ada"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-24T17:21:34.498417037Z","model":"glm-5.3"}